{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"sync-notify-stored-notifications-accumulate-001","description":"t.sig calls notify_one twice at time 0, before anyone waits. Rust's Notify stores one notification per call made with no waiter and each later waiter consumes one (sync/notify.rs notify_one: \"stored notifications accumulate\", unlike tokio's single permit). The waiters arrive at 10, 20 and 30: t.w1 and t.w2 pass at once, without parking, and t.w3, which finds none left, parks until t.sig's third notify_one at 300.","unit":"sync","rules":["inv.determinism.replayable"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":1000},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[],"sync":[{"name":"n","type":"notify"}],"tasks":[{"name":"t.sig","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"notify_one","notify":"n"},{"op":"notify_one","notify":"n"},{"op":"sleep","ns":300},{"op":"trace","message":"third signal"},{"op":"notify_one","notify":"n"}]},{"name":"t.w1","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":10},{"op":"notify_wait","notify":"n"},{"op":"trace","message":"w1 passed"}]},{"name":"t.w2","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":20},{"op":"notify_wait","notify":"n"},{"op":"trace","message":"w2 passed"}]},{"name":"t.w3","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":30},{"op":"notify_wait","notify":"n"},{"op":"trace","message":"w3 passed"}]}],"script":[],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
